knowledge more accessible.

00:28:31.559 --> 00:28:35.619
And I think you provided
just a tremendous resource

00:28:35.619 --> 00:28:37.379
to so many, so thank you.

00:28:37.379 --> 00:28:38.879
- No, well it's a lot more than me,

00:28:38.879 --> 00:28:40.129
