00:28:40.129 --> 00:28:41.249
And I'm gonna follow up with you,

00:28:41.249 --> 00:28:43.329
I think there's ways that
we could work together.

00:28:43.329 --> 00:28:44.629
- That'd be great.

00:28:44.629 --> 00:28:45.462
All the best.

00:28:46.339 --> 00:28:47.322
- Yup, thank you.

00:28:48.753 --> 00:28:51.479
Thanks everyone.

00:28:51.479 --> 00:28:55.060
As always, Dean Noguera, was really great,

00:28:55.060 --> 00:28:58.099
and I wish we had another
five hours to chat

00:28:58.099 --> 00:29:00.219
